  "summary": "Malicious code in @rbx-ts/services (npm)",
  "details": "The postinstall hook (scripts/postinstall.js) is a Windows-only dropper. On win32 it downloads a zip archive from a remote URL into %TEMP%, extracts it with PowerShell Expand-Archive, recursively scans the extracted directory, and launches every.exe it finds as a detached process, then deletes the zip. Installing this package on Windows downloads and executes an arbitrary remote binary.",
